===============================================================================
DISCLAIMER
===============================================================================

Everything here is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. This covers the code, the data panels, the report, the notes and the
slides alike.

Everything under project/instructor-build/ -- the code, the tests, the notes,
the panels and the 53-page report -- was produced by an AI agent and published
as a record of what that workflow produces, bugs included. No human analyst
wrote or reviewed it. It is not software to depend on and not analysis to rely
on. One field in the panels is knowingly wrong and the report inherits it;
project/README.md and project/instructor-build/README.md say which.

Nothing here is investment advice, a recommendation, or an offer. The teaching
material discusses Ares Capital Corporation because its SEC filings are public
and hard to parse, for no other reason. Nothing here is endorsed by, affiliated
with, or reviewed by Ares Capital Corporation, the SEC, or Yale University.


