===============================================================================
DATA
===============================================================================

project/output/*.csv is derived from Ares Capital Corporation's 10-K and 10-Q
filings on SEC EDGAR. Those filings are public records, freely redistributable,
and each row carries its own source_url. The licensed work here is the schema,
the parsing decisions and the coverage choices.


